    "detailed_description": "Ignition Arena is a free-to-play, fast-paced blend of tactical strategy and exhilarating combat. Set in dynamic, space-themed arenas, players engage in thrilling PvP battles where every second counts, and one wrong move can be fatal. Whether dodging enemy fire, switching layers to evade attacks, or using equipment to counter opponents, the action is relentless. Victory relies not only on combat skills but also on the ability to outthink and outmaneuver rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/6586539dab33cf36740f5faad54d7569.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/6586539dab33cf36740f5faad54d7569.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/6586539dab33cf36740f5faad54d7569.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build and modify your ship using a vast array of components, weapons, and equipment. Create a ship that suits your playstyle and prepare for any scenario. Whether it\u2019s dodging tracking missiles or grappling enemies to get the upper hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/941232fbed893e8f325a51f218aacada.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/941232fbed893e8f325a51f218aacada.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/941232fbed893e8f325a51f218aacada.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/75b0ebb6bef72b9688b9e70e78975054.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/75b0ebb6bef72b9688b9e70e78975054.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/75b0ebb6bef72b9688b9e70e78975054.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Battles are intense and fast-paced, requiring both quick reflexes and careful planning. Choose the right equipment, position yourself strategically, and adapt your loadout to counter your opponents\u2019 tactics. While ship customization offers depth, the outcome of each battle is determined by player skill. Precision, timing, and mastery of piloting mechanics are crucial to surviving and winning matches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/1abcd07b52fb3b03920db9586f4804e4.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/1abcd07b52fb3b03920db9586f4804e4.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/1abcd07b52fb3b03920db9586f4804e4.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa26132c88aabd851cc94d38db2377da.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa26132c88aabd851cc94d38db2377da.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa26132c88aabd851cc94d38db2377da.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight in unique arenas that challenge your strategies with environmental hazards and distinctive layouts. These dynamic battlegrounds force players to adapt and stay vigilant in the heat of combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa7b04df5e37eca7ae78aa3a2ea4a801.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa7b04df5e37eca7ae78aa3a2ea4a801.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa7b04df5e37eca7ae78aa3a2ea4a801.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/bd78e0e6b9099fe20368593b10e1da53.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/bd78e0e6b9099fe20368593b10e1da53.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/bd78e0e6b9099fe20368593b10e1da53.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wield an arsenal of creative and deadly weapons like the Lightning Cannon, Pulse Lasers, Grappling Hook, and much more. Each weapon offers unique tactical advantages, adding layers of strategy to every encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/944d72230b242ddfd84ca7ef23b51183.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/944d72230b242ddfd84ca7ef23b51183.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/944d72230b242ddfd84ca7ef23b51183.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Modes</h2>Jump into the action with multiple game modes including chaotic free-for-all skirmishes and strategic 3v3 objective-based battles. Stay tuned as we finalize our modes before launch!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Lore</h2>You are a prisoner, spared the death sentence by volunteering to become an Ignition Arena gladiator. For the amusement of the wealthy, you fight for your life and your freedom, building ships, gathering weaponry, and clashing with fellow gladiators, elite military personnel, and even otherworldly creatures. Your survival means more than entertainment\u2014it fuels the war effort of the Terran Federation against the Unified Colonies. But how long can you last in a world where every battle is a life-or-death gamble?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Launch Support</h2>The journey doesn\u2019t end at launch. Expect ongoing support with new content like weapons, maps, and customization options. We\u2019re committed to hotfixes, patches, and regular community-driven events to keep the game fresh and engaging.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Community </h2>Be part of the game\u2019s evolution. Join our regular playtests, give feedback, and help shape the future of Ignition Arena. The community is at the heart of our development process.",
    "about_the_game": "Ignition Arena is a free-to-play, fast-paced blend of tactical strategy and exhilarating combat. Set in dynamic, space-themed arenas, players engage in thrilling PvP battles where every second counts, and one wrong move can be fatal. Whether dodging enemy fire, switching layers to evade attacks, or using equipment to counter opponents, the action is relentless. Victory relies not only on combat skills but also on the ability to outthink and outmaneuver rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/6586539dab33cf36740f5faad54d7569.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/6586539dab33cf36740f5faad54d7569.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/6586539dab33cf36740f5faad54d7569.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build and modify your ship using a vast array of components, weapons, and equipment. Create a ship that suits your playstyle and prepare for any scenario. Whether it\u2019s dodging tracking missiles or grappling enemies to get the upper hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/941232fbed893e8f325a51f218aacada.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/941232fbed893e8f325a51f218aacada.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/941232fbed893e8f325a51f218aacada.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span 