60/extras/aa26132c88aabd851cc94d38db2377da.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa26132c88aabd851cc94d38db2377da.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight in unique arenas that challenge your strategies with environmental hazards and distinctive layouts. These dynamic battlegrounds force players to adapt and stay vigilant in the heat of combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa7b04df5e37eca7ae78aa3a2ea4a801.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa7b04df5e37eca7ae78aa3a2ea4a801.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/aa7b04df5e37eca7ae78aa3a2ea4a801.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/bd78e0e6b9099fe20368593b10e1da53.poster.avif?t=1733186536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/bd78e0e6b9099fe20368593b10e1da53.webm?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228760/extras/bd78e0e6b9099fe20368593b10e1da53.mp4?t=1733186536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wield an arsenal of creative and deadly weapons like the Lightning Cannon, Pulse Lasers, Grappling Hook, and much more. Each weapon offers unique tactical advantages, adding layers of strategy to every encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_